133:{"timestamp":"2026-07-25T05:37:48.358Z","type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"function_call_output","call_id":"call_Bo9LXGiPNjtZdj8y9M9RI95b","output":"Chunk ID: 7dcc2e\nWall time: 0.0000 seconds\nProcess exited with code 0\nOriginal token count: 848\nOutput:\n     1\trequires \"verification.k\"\n     2\t\n     3\tmodule SPEC\n     4\t  imports VERIFICATION\n     5\t\n     6\t  claim [loop-inv]:\n     7\t    <k>\n     8\t      #loop(\n     9\t        str(CODES:IntSeq),\n    10\t        Name(\"bracket\"),\n    11\t        If(Compare(Name(\"bracket\"), CmpOp(\"==\", Str(\"<\"))),\n    12\t          AugAssign(Name(\"balance\"), \"+\", Int(1)),\n    13\t          AugAssign(Name(\"balance\"), \"-\", Int(1)))\n    14\t        If(Compare(Name(\"balance\"), CmpOp(\"<\", Int(0))),\n    15\t          Assign(Name(\"valid\"), Bool(false)),\n    16\t          )\n    17\t      ) => .K\n    18\t      ...\n    19\t    </k>\n    20\t    <env> LOCAL:Int </env>\n    21\t    <scopes>\n    22\t      ...\n    23\t      LOCAL |-> scope(\n    24\t        \"balance\"  |-> (BAL:Int => BAL +Int bracketDelta(CODES))\n    25\t        \"bracket\"  |-> (_OLD:Val => ?NEW:Val)\n    26\t        \"brackets\" |-> ORIGINAL:Str\n    27\t        \"valid\"    |-> (VALID:Bool\n    28\t                        => VALID andBool bracketPrefixOK(CODES, BAL)),\n    29\t        PARENT:Parent)\n    30\t      ...\n    31\t    </scopes>\n    32\t    requires bracketChars(CODES)\n    33\t\n    34\t  claim [correct-bracketing]:\n    35\t    <k>\n    36\t      Call(Name(\"correct_bracketing\"), str(CODES:IntSeq))\n    37\t      => ?RESULT:Bool\n    38\t    </k>\n    39\t    <env> 0 </env>\n    40\t    <scopes>\n    41\t      0 |-> scope(\n    42\t        \"correct_bracketing\" |->\n    43\t          closureVal(\n    44\t            (\"brackets\", .ParamNames),\n    45\t            Assign(Name(\"balance\"), Int(0))\n    46\t            Assign(Name(\"valid\"), Bool(true))\n    47\t            Assign(Name(\"bracke