+| `float.k` | 34 | 121 | unreachable |
+| `str.k` | 5 | 28 | ASCII literals, string equality, string iteration |
+| `set.k` | 6 | 12 | unreachable |
+| `list.k` | 5 | 27 | unreachable in the target |
